"Which DualSense button is which of the controller's.\n"
"A is on Circle and B on Cross by default, where the Wii U has them."
msgstr ""
"Welke DualSense-knop welke knop van de controller is.\n"
"Standaard zit A op Cirkel en B op Kruis, waar de Wii U ze heeft."

